### Testar API do Harvest.js

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Autenticação
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

@token = {{ login.response.body.access_token }}

###

POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456",
  "farmName": "Fazenda Teste"
}

###

GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Usuários
GET http://localhost:3000/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

PUT http://localhost:3000/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Updated Name",
  "farmName": "My Farm"
}

###

### Farm Controller - Rotas Principais

### GET /farm - O Estado da Terra
GET http://localhost:3000/farm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### POST /farm/unlock - Expansão
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 6
}

###

### POST /farm/plant - Ação de Plantar
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/plant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0,
  "cropSlug": "wheat"
}

###

### POST /farm/harvest - Ação de Colher
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/harvest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0
}

### Testes de Fluxo Completo

### 1. Login para obter token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

@token = {{ login.response.body.access_token }}

###

### 2. Ver perfil do usuário
GET http://localhost:3000/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Ver estado inicial da fazenda
GET http://localhost:3000/farm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Plantar trigo no terreno 0
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/plant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0,
  "cropSlug": "wheat"
}

### 5. Tentar colher antes do tempo (deve dar erro)
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/harvest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0
}

### 6. Esperar 30 segundos e colher
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/harvest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 0
}

### 7. Desbloquear novo terreno
POST http://localhost:3000/farm/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plotIndex": 6
}

